		<name>Delhi Metro</name>
		<summary>Plan Delhi Metro journeys with fares, maps, and line status</summary>
		<desc>Delhi Metro is a Material 3 companion app for the Delhi Metro network.

Plan trips between stations with least-distance or minimum-interchange
strategies, edit endpoints on the results screen, and swap origin and
destination without starting over. Browse lines and stations, check
first and last train times, follow service alerts, and open the network
map with zoom and PDF share.

Features:

* Journey planner with strategy toggle
* Editable origin and destination on route results
* Station search with local cache
* Line explorer and station detail
* Network map view with share
* Notifications / service alerts
* Light, dark, and Material You theming

Releases are built with Expo EAS, published on GitHub Releases, and
mirrored into this F-Droid-compatible repository.

Package ID: codes.tashif.delhimetro
</desc>
