		<name>Paisa</name>
		<summary>Offline-first personal finance for Android</summary>
		<desc>Paisa keeps your money ledger on your phone.

Bank SMS is parsed on-device (100+ Indian banks via an AGPL parser
core). Optional BYOK statement import for PDF/CSV/images — your API
key, your endpoint; SMS never leaves the device.

Features:
* Home balance, filters, and recent transactions
* Analytics charts with date ranges
* Monthly budgets by category
* Multiple accounts / wallets
* SMS bulk scan + live receiver with hash dedup
* App lock via biometrics or device credential
* Export to CSV / PDF

Package ID: codes.tashif.paisa
</desc>
